    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Brady is delighted to bring to the market this charming 2-Bedroom End-of-Terrace Bungalow. \nA wonderful opportunity to acquire a charming 2-bedroom end-of-terrace bungalow, ideally situated in a peaceful and quaint cul-de-sac in Drogheda.\nThe property extends to 63 sq. m. and offers comfortable living in a quiet residential setting, while being conveniently located with Drogheda town centre, shops, restaurants, services, transport links and the local hospital all within easy reach.\nThe accommodation comprises entrance hall, kitchen, living-room, two bedrooms, bathroom and a sun room.\nOne of the property's standout features is the large, enclosed and very private rear garden. The garden is not overlooked, creating a wonderfully secluded outdoor space. There is a storage shed which provides useful additional storage.\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
